<title>GERMANY: Wella to hold 1996 dividend steady.</title>
<headline>Wella to hold 1996 dividend steady.</headline>
<dateline>DARMSTADT, Germany 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend per ordinary share		13 dmk vs same</p>
<p>    Dividend per preference share	    14 dmk vs same</p>
<p>Dividend will be paid after annual meeting on June 4 1997.</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Wella AG. The company also said its total dividend payout was 34.7 million marks. The allocation to earnings reserves was 25.9 million marks. More details on the company's performance would be provided on April 22.</p>
</text>
